abstract: >-
  An exploratory, vendor-neutral proposal for portable functional definitions
  of integration interfaces, observable contracts, conformance assessment
  and independent outcome-driven comparative evaluation. Includes Spanish
  reference text and a complete English translation.
keywords:
  - integration interfaces
  - functional portability
  - interoperability
  - conformance
  - end-to-end benchmarks
